  LT.lt.{0} 0 ε →
    MethbokeAddon.WeakFouriermanB.initialFrontSpacetime T ⊆ MethbokeAddon.WeakFouriermanB.analyticCapSpacetime ε T
TYPE_END:MethbokeAddon.WeakFouriermanB.initial_front_subset_analytic_cap
